[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17107.27, "timestamp": "04:45:07", "text": "这里。可以吗？这里。这里。在后面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17114.11, "timestamp": "04:45:14", "text": "在哪里？这里。这里。这里。这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17116.868, "timestamp": "04:45:16", "text": "在后面。哦，给你。是的。来。来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17120.39, "timestamp": "04:45:20", "text": "来。你在哪里摔倒的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17122.628, "timestamp": "04:45:22", "text": "这边。这边。这边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17126.868, "timestamp": "04:45:26", "text": "笔直向下。向上。向上。向上。没倒下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17130.31, "timestamp": "04:45:30", "text": "是的。你看到了吗？一根柱子。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17134.83, "timestamp": "04:45:34", "text": "那是你的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17138.39, "timestamp": "04:45:38", "text": "呃，那里也什么都没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17141.27, "timestamp": "04:45:41", "text": "你有没有在我们附近看到陶器之类的东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17148.23, "timestamp": "04:45:48", "text": "利用这些冰路。由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17151.03, "timestamp": "04:45:51", "text": "道路，冰路。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17153.67, "timestamp": "04:45:53", "text": "是的，我们可以很快地从一个地方转移到另一个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17157.11, "timestamp": "04:45:57", "text": "使用这些工具从一个地方移动到另一个地方。如果其中一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17159.82, "timestamp": "04:45:59", "text": "我们拥有丝滑般的触感。"}]